on, approvals and remote-area rescues."}, {"kind": "other", "event_ids": ["A9", "A10"], "reason": "T2 duplicates T1, so no rival theories exist. The repeated near-identical searches (A4–A8) add no new evidence."}, {"kind": "other", "event_ids": ["A12", "A14"], "reason": "Misclassifies verified news observations as independent studies. This overstates their evidential type."}], "suitable_for_training": false, "screen_reason": "The episode is incomplete: it stopped before experiment design and recommendation (A15). It also contains an unsupported factual assertion in the core mechanism (A9/A10) and duplicated theories (A10). Incomplete episodes are rejected."}
